{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "4e6cf372ba57419bd8ad896b089184656be3a4953e35721e1c0a5a4d534302a3", "ja": "これからも一緒に", "zh": "今后也一起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8be80a015323adead0181caa8d1408d90630683ffd7c0d67bca4e1ad0a5453c2", "ja": "翌日、劇場で打ち上げをするアイドルたち。\nなぜか彼女らの息はぴったりで……前にも\nこんなことがあったような？　いや、きっと\nこれも仲良しだからだろう。プロデューサー\nも到着して、楽しい時間は続くのだった。", "zh": "第二天，偶像们在剧场举行庆功宴。不知为何，她们配合得天衣无缝……总觉得以前也发生过类似的事？不，肯定也是因为她们关系要好吧。制作人也到了，欢乐的时光仍在继续。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "cbd5877886af47f0eafba6f0be1f4b46a819d66d4ec1c6517fabf420c8d60aa4", "ja": "公演の翌日……", "zh": "公演的第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "171621242238f918e3d3d178c026e9ce195ab5cda376c83ecef47c395c421534", "ja": "兄ちゃんてば、お寿司でも天ぷらでもなく、\n劇場で打ち上げなんて……ちょっと手抜きじゃない？", "zh": "哥哥真是的，寿司也不是，天妇罗也不是，居然在剧场办庆功宴……是不是有点偷懒了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "cc86ba931ffe34097bd630e8367c78a0b99fd14f3527f8fe483c168a20691a2a", "ja": "劇場での打ち上げも楽しいわよ～。\nそれに、差し入れを買ってきてくれるそうだし……。", "zh": "在剧场举办庆功宴也很开心呀～  \n而且听说还会有人买慰问品带过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "d31f55620704fe687a4aaeefbabf5174a88e7290c8d399289a97d47304f49e3e", "ja": "そうそう！　それに、予算を決めて好きなものを\n持ち寄りなんて、なんだかピクニックみたいじゃない？", "zh": "对对！而且大家定好预算，各自带喜欢的东西来，感觉就像野餐一样，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "be49411877e9ccd1b27685afd39cf361c15e03ab6c0ee76172b1eb5d11b491c7", "ja": "私は、馬場家特製カレーを作ってきたわ！\nたくさんあるから、お腹いっぱい食べてね♪", "zh": "我做了马场家特制的咖喱带过来！有很多呢，尽管吃，吃个饱吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6a6437c714617e386a0e0098842be62afce5abe06ceaa52ec10d31c2306add5e", "ja": "わぁ♪　嬉しい……このみさんのカレーって\nすっごく美味しいですよね！　隠し味がいいのかな？", "zh": "哇♪好开心……这可是好美味的呢！\n是因为加了秘制调料吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "f06f9907d936e7c7a2919073e9253a7c4683f42c41947620d8ebe60b5eaf569d", "ja": "ありがと、風花ちゃん♪　でもね……\n私としたことが、福神漬けを忘れちゃったの……！", "zh": "谢谢，风花♪不过呢……\n真是的，我居然忘了准备福神腌菜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "db65fc8d357ab6776b054e4e91398e1eaee6157a735704df35b6931ea0241b3d", "ja": "あっ、私、福神漬けをつけてきましたよ！\n最近、オリジナルの福神漬け作りにハマってて。", "zh": "啊，我腌了福神渍带过来哦！\n最近我迷上了自制福神渍呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "07dd74c469f8080f29e2d5cdb3f300018ca6e99294365d3d14638eda11865c4a", "ja": "まぁ……福神漬けを、手作りしたの？\nすごいわ、麗花ちゃん。", "zh": "哎呀……福神渍是你自己亲手做的吗？\n真厉害呢，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "40ebbf9755a9a9cc77c43a5d1738800ade484693c606328edbb5e1d20a1d355f", "ja": "レイカの福神漬け、\nカラフルでとってもおいしそうだったヨ～♪", "zh": "丽花的福神腌菜，五颜六色的，看起来特别好吃哟～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "e80df24c8181a2274317d62ff5fe7df2e9e72f5a1eed163bf0a0570a423ab57f", "ja": "真美は、デザートにプリンを買ってきたんだけど。\nスプーンをもらい忘れちゃったんだよね～。", "zh": "真美买了布丁当甜点，可是忘记拿勺子了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e647b7f10de53cbfab49f455cfa4f1a12b480f47002c62e8a2b2048d383f446", "ja": "プラスチックのスプーンだったら、\nちょうどここにあるよ！　はい、どうぞ♪", "zh": "要是塑料勺的话，正好这里有一把哦！来，给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eaeeccd3589d16ac6372f3653b7b264bc91a0a029aeab91c2c1a7fc3654bf269", "ja": "……なんだかさっきから、\n不思議とタイミングがいいような……？", "zh": "……总觉得从刚才开始，\n时机都好得有些不可思议……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "489a5dd09e162b136e15790cb02d897da6038bee85a14084291ed6e061da2201", "ja": "？　そういえばそうだネ。\n最近、他にもこんなコトがあったような……？", "zh": "？说起来，好像确实是呢。最近，好像还发生过其他类似的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "358c41264eb7fc859679b14218b93b4e96b128bc4fa93792cb60e626d5d405df", "ja": "ううん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "358c41264eb7fc859679b14218b93b4e96b128bc4fa93792cb60e626d5d405df", "ja": "ううん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "40d881d985b7b6a1b27c4a59d3f3e4a6080bfc687a4b3d01ffe4bb5c99d69329", "ja": "きっと、私たちの息が、\nいつもピッタリってことだよね♪", "zh": "一定是因为我们总是配合得天衣无缝吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1017_se", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "f46a8c0d385bf005dfbd526a55c9c99d3576e90083cb97f6216feb305b90efcc", "ja": "あ、{$P$}から連絡だヨ～。色々\n買いすぎちゃったから、車まで取りに来て、だって！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}联系我了哟～。说是买太多东西了，让我们到车那边去拿呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "e62e7ab097ea018b9cc3b028a47c61ede711a4d75fefa60220ec50006a3d2806", "ja": "あらあら、大変。\nそれじゃ、みんなで行きましょうか～。", "zh": "哎呀呀，这可不得了。\n那我们大家一起去吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "49ec22c589333dabf5cb62eaa1881ee3c5aac3d51cbbd7c9711b9266e9503b65", "ja": "そうですね、そうしましょう！\nふふっ……それじゃ、行ってきます♪", "zh": "是啊，就这么办吧！\n呵呵……那我们出发啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_07_1021_gekijyounotamasii", "source_sha256": "f1de483ee61a2dd12bdcfed675bbeb1880797ab983e03cc6558ca5b61ff4d461", "ja": "……行ってらっしゃい、みんな。", "zh": "……路上小心，大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
